---
/**
 * Port of the old site's `service-dynamic-dashboards.html` `#ejemplo`
 * Aurora Bank dashboard (heaviest demo). Verbatim markup and class names;
 * used-selector CSS remapped to v2 tokens under the
 * `[data-demo="dashboards"]` root (design D3). Old page-local `<style>`
 * block ported 1:1; `portfolio.css` used selectors merged in; the
 * `[data-theme="dark"]` override block is dropped (v2 is always-tokenized).
 * One guarded inline IIFE (D1/D4): 4 tabpanels + 4s autoplay and 3s
 * live-drift engine, count-up/replay/reset, pause on hover/focus + hidden,
 * kept 1:1 (random walk ranges identical). RM policy (D2): full static
 * early-return exactly like the old engine — no .pd-anim class, no timers,
 * badge title 'Live updates paused (prefers-reduced-motion): showing
 * static data', static markup values remain.
 * Chart palette: old decor series colors become root vars so the JS drift
 * strings can rebuild gradients with vars: --pd-donut-1 = var(--primary-text)
 * (old navy series), --pd-donut-2 pink / --pd-donut-3 amber / --pd-donut-4
 * sky (AA-tuned per theme), --pd-donut-rest = var(--muted) (old #e2e8f0 ring
 * rest); old Excel-green accents map to var(--demo-ok). Responsive blocks
 * (1100px / 768px) converted from media queries to container queries (D5);
 * the `max-width:1280px` inline style is kept verbatim. Old CTAs dropped.
 */
